CREATED:20260430T131115Z
DESCRIPTION:Shift your perspective. \n\nCome explore our annual exhibition
  of student documentary work and new creative visions!\n\nThis year's exh
 ibition\, "Shifts: New Expressions 2026\," includes documentary photograp
 hy\, film\, and installations from 70+ students - each piece offering a d
 ifferent way of seeing and understanding the world around us. \n\n"Shifts
 : New Expressions 2026" opened on April 23 and will be on view into the s
 ummer\, so you can keep coming back to take it all in.
DURATION:P60D
