DESCRIPTION:During this activity\, learners will:\n\n\n* Review next gener
 ation mass spectrometry for proteomic and functional proteomic measuremen
 ts\n \n\n* Discuss these capabilities in the context of biomarker discove
 ry and/or cellular mechanisms in disease states\n\n\n* Review imaging mas
 s spectrometry for spatial analysis of proteins and metabolites
