CREATED:20260423T185303Z
DESCRIPTION:The MFA in Experimental and Documentary Arts program at Duke U
 niversity is proud to congratulate the Class of 2026 on the successful co
 mpletion of the degree and their thesis projects. Please join us at Duke'
 s Center for Documentary Studies to fête the cohort Saturday\, May 9 at 3
 :00pm\, an occasion to properly express our pride and admiration with fri
 ends and families. The class of 2026 is an inspired and inspiring collect
 ion of artists\, activists\, colleagues and collaborators. We will be see
 ing more from them.\n\nMFA|EDA Class of 2026 Commencement Celebration\nSa
 turday\, May 9\n3:00pm\nDuke Center for Documentary Studies\n1317 West Pe
 ttigrew\nFree street parking\nmfaeda.duke.edu
DURATION:PT2H
